# --- Reasoning integration (kept private) ---
# This entire folder -- the reasoning contract and the HTTP client that
# calls out to a configured endpoint -- is excluded from the public
# repo. app/workers/tasks.py imports it via a soft try/except and
# degrades gracefully when it's absent (see REASONING_AVAILABLE there),
# so the rest of Ghost Protocol -- ingestion, behavioral graph,
# bottleneck detection, incident correlation, evidence, simulation --
# works fully without it. Keep this folder locally; just never `git add`
# it in the public copy of this repo.
app/reasoning/

